# Speak-Sync Project - Comprehensive Analysis

## 📋 Executive Summary

**Speak-Sync** is an AI-powered personal assistant application with voice interaction, task management, habit tracking, and intelligent scheduling. The project uses a **microservices architecture** with 5 backend services and a Flutter mobile app.

**Status**: ✅ Backend fully deployed and operational | 🚧 Flutter app in development

**Deployment**: Production server at `210.79.128.219`

---

## 🏗️ Architecture Overview

### System Architecture

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                     Flutter Mobile App                       │
│              (Android/iOS - Riverpod + Dio)                  │
└────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────────┘
                     │ HTTP/REST
                     ↓
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                  Gateway Service (Port 3000)                 │
│         Express.js - Auth, Rate Limiting, Routing            │
└─┬───────────────┬──────────────┬──────────────┬────────────┘
  │               │              │              │
  ↓               ↓              ↓              ↓
┌─────────┐  ┌──────────┐  ┌──────────┐  ┌──────────────┐
│Scheduler│  │AI Brain  │  │Lifestyle │  │Worker Service│
│(3001)   │  │(8000)    │  │(8001)    │  │(Background)  │
└─────────┘  └──────────┘  └──────────┘  └──────────────┘
     │            │             │               │
     ↓            ↓             ↓               ↓
┌──────────┐ ┌─────────┐  ┌─────────┐    ┌─────────┐
│PostgreSQL│ │MongoDB  │  │MongoDB  │    │RabbitMQ │
│+ Prisma  │ │+pgvector│  │         │    │         │
└──────────┘ └─────────┘  └─────────┘    └─────────┘
```

### Technology Stack

| Layer | Technologies |
|-------|-------------|
| **Mobile** | Flutter 3.38.4, Dart 3.10.3, Riverpod, Dio |
| **Backend (Node.js)** | Express.js, TypeScript, Prisma, RabbitMQ |
| **Backend (Python)** | FastAPI, Pydantic, Motor (MongoDB), pgvector |
| **Databases** | PostgreSQL, MongoDB Atlas, Redis |
| **AI/ML** | OpenAI Whisper (STT), Groq Llama 3.3 (LLM), OpenAI TTS |
| **Message Queue** | RabbitMQ (AMQP) |
| **Infrastructure** | Docker, Docker Compose, pnpm workspace |

