## 📱 Flutter Mobile App

### Architecture

**Pattern**: Clean Architecture + Feature-based structure

```
lib/
├── core/
│   ├── config/          # API endpoints, environment
│   ├── di/              # Dependency injection (GetIt)
│   ├── network/         # Dio HTTP client + interceptors
│   ├── storage/         # Secure storage (JWT tokens)
│   └── utils/           # Helpers, extensions
├── features/
│   ├── auth/            # Login, registration
│   ├── chat/            # AI conversations
│   ├── tasks/           # Task management
│   ├── calendar/        # Events & scheduling
│   ├── habits/          # Habit tracking
│   ├── voice/           # Voice interaction
│   └── profile/         # User settings
├── shared/
│   ├── widgets/         # Reusable UI components
│   ├── models/          # Shared data models
│   └── theme/           # Material 3 theme
└── routes/              # GoRouter navigation
```

### State Management

**Riverpod** (chosen for type safety and modern approach)

```dart
// Example provider
@riverpod
class TasksNotifier extends _$TasksNotifier {
  @override
  Future<List<Task>> build() async {
    return await ref.read(taskRepositoryProvider).getTasks();
  }

  Future<void> createTask(Task task) async {
    await ref.read(taskRepositoryProvider).createTask(task);
    ref.invalidateSelf();
  }
}
```

### Key Dependencies

```yaml
dependencies:
  # State Management
  flutter_riverpod: ^2.6.1
  
  # Networking
  dio: ^5.7.0
  retrofit: ^4.5.0
  
