## 🔄 Inter-Service Communication

### RabbitMQ Event Flow

```
Scheduler Service → RabbitMQ → Worker Service
                              → AI Brain Service (analytics)
                              → Lifestyle Service (study habit)

Lifecycle Service → RabbitMQ → AI Brain Service (pattern analysis)
```

**Event Types**:
```javascript
{
  "task.created": { taskId, userId, title, priority },
  "task.completed": { taskId, userId, completedAt },
  "event.created": { eventId, userId, startTime },
  "habit.logged": { habitId, userId, habitType, data }
}
```

