## 🚀 Development Workflow

### Local Setup

```bash
# 1. Install dependencies
pnpm install

# 2. Setup environment
cp .env.example .env
# Edit .env with your credentials

# 3. Start services
pnpm dev:gateway       # Terminal 1 (Port 3000)
pnpm dev:scheduler     # Terminal 2 (Port 3001)
pnpm dev:worker        # Terminal 3

# Python services
cd apps/ai-brain-service && uvicorn src.main:app --reload --port 8000
cd apps/lifestyle-service && uvicorn src.main:app --reload --port 8001

# 4. Run Flutter app
cd flutter/speak_sync_app
flutter pub get
flutter run
```

### Docker Deployment

```bash
# Production deployment
docker-compose -f docker-compose.prod.yml up -d

# Development
docker-compose up -d
```

